WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.849 --> 00:00:06.569
A clash at sea causing waves of international
concern.

00:00:06.569 --> 00:00:13.060
A Russian military ship rams into a Ukrainian
tugboat off the coast of Crimea.

00:00:13.060 --> 00:00:17.340
The vessel was later fired at and captured
by the Russians, along with two other ships

00:00:17.340 --> 00:00:23.860
and dozens of Ukrainian seamen, several of
whom were injured.

00:00:23.860 --> 00:00:28.100
The United Nations Security Council held an
emergency meeting where western countries

00:00:28.100 --> 00:00:33.920
accused Russia of stoking an already deadly
war with Ukraine.

00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:38.129
What we witnessed this weekend was another
reckless Russian escalation.

00:00:38.129 --> 00:00:46.729
(WB) It is an arrogant act that the international
community must condemn and will never accept."

00:00:46.729 --> 00:00:51.559
In response, Russia's representative said
the Ukrainan ship had violated ITS territorial

00:00:51.559 --> 00:00:52.940
waters.

00:00:52.940 --> 00:00:57.930
Moscow says the incident was a provocation
by Ukrainian president Petro Poroshenko to

00:00:57.930 --> 00:01:00.909
boost his support in upcoming elections.

00:01:00.909 --> 00:01:08.369
In Kiev, Poroshenko has declared a state of
martial law for 30 days, but insisted it would

00:01:08.369 --> 00:01:12.670
not interfere with the looming presidential
vote.

00:01:12.670 --> 00:01:17.500
In Brussels, Nato's secretary general warned
Russia that its actions would have consequences.

00:01:17.500 --> 00:01:24.689
There is no justification for Russia's use
of military force.

00:01:24.689 --> 00:01:41.130
(WB) So we call on Russia to release immediately
the Ukrainan sailors and ships it seized yesterday.

00:01:41.130 --> 00:01:46.509
Sea traffic is again flowing through the disputed
waters after Russia briefly blocked the crucial

00:01:46.509 --> 00:01:47.509
passage.

00:01:47.509 --> 00:01:52.530
But Moscow says it will continue to hold the
Ukrainian ships and sailors while it conducts

00:01:52.530 --> 00:02:29.170
its

00:02:29.170 --> 00:07:01.080
own investigation.

